# Generated by semantic-release and committed by the release job, which runs
# no hook. Prettier would rewrite its bullets from * to -, and the next
# release would put them back, so the file is left in the shape its
# generator writes.
CHANGELOG.md

# Prettier is here for Markdown and YAML and nothing else — the two file
# types Biome does not format. Everything Biome does format is listed here
# so that a bare `prettier --write .` cannot quietly take the JavaScript off
# it and start a formatter war in the pre-commit hook.
*.js
*.jsx
*.ts
*.tsx
*.json
*.jsonc
*.css
